{"id":"acabado","lemma":"acabado","pos":"adj","rank":847,"glosses":["worn-out","finished","moneyless; out of money; having no (or very little) money; poor"],"ipa":"/akaˈbado/","forms":{"feminine":"acabada","masculinePlural":"acabados","femininePlural":"acabadas"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/6d/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-acabado.wav","examples":[{"text":"¿Has acabado los deberes?","en":"Are you through with your homework?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/352571"},{"text":"Mi vida está casi acabada.","en":"My life is almost over.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/845607"},{"text":"Se ha acabado el coñac.","en":"The brandy is all gone.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/459244"},{"text":"Creo que se ha acabado.","en":"I believe it's finished.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/297626"},{"text":"¿Te has acabado este libro?","en":"Are you through with this book?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/645646"}]}